Read AGENTS.md first. It is the single source of truth for this workspace.

Use the namespace of the model you actually run as (see ai-models.json): claude, gpt, gemini, qwen, glm, llama, mistral, grok, kimi, doubao, ernie, or agent.

Never write caches, plans or logs into another model's directory. Pass -Model <slug> to every script under tools/ai/.
